            "text": "I’m exploring ways to automate workflows for an on-demand service application that connects customers with service providers. How can n8n help automate booking confirmations, provider assignment notifications, payment status updates, and customer alerts? Can webhooks and integrations with external APIs handle these processes efficiently? I’d also like to understand how to manage failed workflows, retry unsuccessful requests, and prevent duplicate notifications when multiple bookings arrive simultaneously. What workflow structure and best practices would you recommend for building a reliable automation system?",
